# Joveo Metrics Specification

## Metric Card Structure
```typescript
interface MetricCardProps {
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  value: string | number;
  delta?: { value: number; trend: 'up' | 'down' | 'flat' };
  chart?: React.ReactNode; // Sparkline or tiny chart only
  footer?: React.ReactNode;
  loading?: boolean;
  error?: string | null;
}
```

## Visual Tokens
- Colors:
  - Title/Text: `#3D4759`
  - Delta Up: `#43A047`
  - Delta Down: `#E53935`
  - Border: `#E2E6F1`
  - Background: `#FFFFFF`
- Typography:
  - Title: SF Pro Text, 14px/20px, 600
  - Value: SF Pro Text, 24px/32px, 600
  - Delta: SF Pro Text, 12px/18px, 500
  - Meta/Secondary: SF Pro Text, 12px/16px, 400
- Layout:
  - Card Radius: 4px
  - Card Padding: 24px
  - Grid: 4-column layout for dashboard metrics
  - Shadow: subtle elevation only

## Exact Layout Rules
```tsx
<Card className="bg-white rounded-[4px] shadow-sm p-6 border border-[#E2E6F1]">
  <div className="flex justify-between items-start mb-4">
    <div className="space-y-1">
      <Typography variant="label" className="text-[#3D4759]">{title}</Typography>
      <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
        <Typography variant="h1" className="text-[#1C2536]">{value}</Typography>
        {delta && (
          <span
            className={cn(
              'text-[12px] leading-[18px] font-medium',
              delta.trend === 'up' && 'text-[#43A047]',
              delta.trend === 'down' && 'text-[#E53935]',
              delta.trend === 'flat' && 'text-[#718096]'
            )}
          >
            {delta.value}%
          </span>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
    {description && <InfoTooltip content={description} />}
  </div>
  {chart && <div className="h-[64px]">{chart}</div>}
  {footer && <div className="mt-4 text-[#718096] text-[12px] leading-[16px]">{footer}</div>}
</Card>
```

## Loading & Error States
```tsx
{loading ? (
  <Card className="bg-white rounded-[4px] shadow-sm p-6 border border-[#E2E6F1]">
    <div className="space-y-3">
      <Skeleton className="h-4 w-24" />
      <Skeleton className="h-8 w-32" />
      <Skeleton className="h-[64px] w-full" />
    </div>
  </Card>
) : error ? (
  <Card className="bg-white rounded-[4px] shadow-sm p-6 border border-[#E2E6F1]">
    <div className="text-[#E53935] text-[12px] leading-[16px]">{error}</div>
  </Card>
) : (
  /* Render standard card as above */
  null
)}
```

## Grid Rules
- Always render metric cards in a 4-column responsive grid.
- Maintain consistent height across all metric cards.
- Only tiny inline charts (sparklines) are allowed; no large charts inside metric cards.

## Forbidden
- No gradients, custom animations, or non-standard colors.
- No custom component variants; use prebuilt Joveo `Card`, `Typography`, `Skeleton`, and `InfoTooltip`.

## Example Sparkline
```tsx
<div className="h-[64px]">
  <MetricSparkline data={data} color="#303F9F" background="#E8EAF6" />
  {/* The sparkline component must adhere to tokens in design.json */}
  {/* Axis labels and legends are not shown for inline metric sparklines */}
  {/* Tooltip is optional and must follow chart interaction rules */}
  {/* Keep padding tight to fit in 64px height */}
  {/* No gridlines inside metric sparkline */}
  {/* Colors must be from series.primary/secondary */}
  {/* Typography must be SF Pro Text with approved sizes */}
  {/* Border radius follows Card container only */}
  {/* No shadows inside sparkline canvas */}
  {/* Loading skeleton is mandatory while fetching */}
</div>
```

